# probe7 -- two-window arrangement for the DESK19 Default-dir pair, adapted to
# the "folder navigates its window" behaviour: Alt+C (slot0=C:\), double-click
# DESKT19 navigates slot0 to C:\DESKT19\, double-click the C: desktop icon
# opens a NEW window slot1=C:\ on top, then a title-bar drag on slot0's own
# (still exposed) title row raises it back to the top and moves it down so
# both windows are visible with C:\DESKT19\ on top (matching win_ontop()).
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 key 38
1550 key 2e
1600 key ae
1650 key b8
2800 mark B_CWIN
3100 move 515 103
3400 down
3403 up
3410 down
3413 up
4100 parkbr
5000 mark C_SUBWIN
5300 move 38 35
5600 down
5603 up
5610 down
5613 up
6300 parkbr
7200 mark D_SECOND
7500 move 300 52
8100 down
8900 drag 300 200
9700 drag 300 350
10500 up
11100 parkbr
12000 mark E_MOVED
